ly captured Shouchun and killed Zhuge Dan. After the founding of Jin, he also served under Du Yu in the campaign against Wu, returning with a great victory.","jp":"魏の武将。諸葛誕の乱の際、司馬昭に従って平定に赴き、最終的に寿春を攻め落として諸葛誕を討ち取った。晋の成立後は杜預に従って呉を攻め、大勝を収めて帰還した。","kr":"위나라의 무장. 제갈탄의 난 때 사마소를 따라 평정에 나섰으며, 마침내 수춘을 함락한 후 제갈탄을 참수했다. 진나라 건국 후에는 두예를 따라 오나라를 공격하여 대승을 거두고 돌아왔다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10696","remark":"","surname":"胡","surnameTc":"胡","surnameEn":"Hu","surnameJp":"胡","surnameKr":"호","surnameOther":"","name":"奋","nameTc":"奮","nameEn":"Fen","nameJp":"奮","nameKr":"분","nameOther":"","word":"玄威","wordTc":"玄威","wordEn":"Xuanwei","wordJp":"玄威","wordKr":"현위","wordOther":"","icon":"胡奋","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"236","city":"CS1002","gender":"0","rule":"71","force":"76","wise":"50","politics":"52","charm":"71","will":"73","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"9","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"8","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"77/31/31/31/31/17/50/31","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1011705","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5000","battleSoulPoint":"5700","debateSoulPoint":"2500","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"2/0/3/0/4/0/2/1/1/1/1/1/2/1/1/0/2/2/1/0/0/2/0/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"13","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3500","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"222","show":"236","death":"288","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP1005802","armor":"WP1008905","helmet":"WP1026605","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;16/1;25/1;31/1","father":"WJ10441/0","mother":